  "final": "Implemented lazy, exactly-once cleanup in `stream_rows`, preserving read/transform errors if cleanup also fails.\n\nUpdated `take` to close its iterator and return `[]` without starting the stream for a zero limit.\n\nVerification passed:\n- `python3 checks/public.py`\n- `python3 checks/lifecycle.py`",
